# The pkl is recompiled per release on the build device (tools/release/
# device_release.sh), same pipeline as the built-in driving model — never
# commit it: it embeds tinygrad JIT kernels for one exact revision and goes
# stale on every tinygrad bump. The ONNX source IS committed (weights are
# pin-stable) as the build input; regenerate the pkl with
# compile_yolo_onnx.py.
yolo_tinygrad.pkl
yolo_tinygrad.pkl.chunk*
yolo_tinygrad.pkl.tinygrad_pin
*.onnx.data
